---
/** The widget answer bot: answers only from published articles, cites them, and hands off to a person. */
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
---
<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[300px]" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-raised shadow-card">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-fg px-4 py-3 text-bg">
      <span class="text-[13.5px] font-semibold">Northwind</span>
      <span class="ml-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-bg/15 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px]"><Icon name="globe" size={10} />Español</span>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-2.5 px-3.5 py-3.5 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.5]">
      <div class="ml-auto w-fit max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-md bg-fg px-3 py-2 text-bg">¿Cómo exporto mis facturas?</div>
      <div class="max-w-[90%] rounded-2xl rounded-bl-md bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-fg">
        <div class="mb-1 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-[9.5px] uppercase tracking-wider text-subtle"><Icon name="sparkles" size={10} />AI answer</div>
        <div>Ve a Facturas, filtra por mes y pulsa Exportar CSV.</div>
        <div class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-bg px-2 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-muted ring-1 ring-line"><Icon name="fileText" size={11} />Export invoices as CSV</div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-1.5">
        <span class="inline-flex h-7 items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-3 text-[11.5px] text-fg ring-1 ring-line">That helped</span>
        <span class="inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-fg px-3 text-[11.5px] text-bg"><Icon name="user" size={11} />Talk to a person</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
